{"id":54913,"date":"2026-07-23T13:33:25","date_gmt":"2026-07-23T12:33:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54913"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:27:01","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:27:01","slug":"corrida-de-paradela","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-paradela\/","title":{"rendered":"V Corrida de Paradela 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">V Corrida de Paradela 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>V Corrida de Paradela 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um prestigiado evento de atletismo de estrada sediado em <strong>Paradela do Vouga<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Sever do Vouga<\/strong>, distrito de Aveiro. Organizada pelo <strong>Centro Desportivo e Cultural de Paradela do Vouga<\/strong> com apoio do munic\u00edpio e da Comunidade Intermunicipal da Regi\u00e3o de Aveiro (CIRA), a 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o afirma-se pela excel\u00eancia desportiva, inclus\u00e3o social e caloroso ambiente comunit\u00e1rio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 sede do clube organizador, o programa inclui a r\u00e1pida <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico, a <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> para todos os ritmos, as provas de forma\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong> (de 500m a 2800m) e a merit\u00f3ria <strong>Corrida Sexto Sentido<\/strong>, dedicada a atletas invisuais e guias. Todos os atletas contam com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica unissexo, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos de s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e medalha finisher de participa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; widt